_5","category":"lobby","text":"(この人に……相応しいわたしになりたい。)","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/cJRCJ1RnkBlGPxAZhYa5wnw4fPXgSXwy.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"せ、先生。いらっしゃい。待ってました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/14oqkKYgr7uMHHWsIIBgLOkkcbHhKriS.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"先生……お帰りなさい。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/MtRnKgAPZm5enHY49ppPoW7wuqgGwfbz.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_MemorialLobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"先生とじゃなかったら……できなかったと思います。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/dIeEZBh8yhzLvWAajhKJ4wH5BsjYhErF.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_MemorialLobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"みんなにプレゼントができたのは、先生のおかげです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/ToIBLqVq8byZB4iGn1gl2tG0p1aCwGHI.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"先生が助けてくれたように……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/JCndUEIWQSxBxTGGg83jV6aESOkjaKhg.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"先生にわたしが必要な瞬間が来たら、何でも言ってくださいね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/NyQiUNFnf34O9A6zGoEzQIlpLq5WfaQ8.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_MemorialLobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"……必ず、恩返しします。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/b0V5oxkGbiJyWjlH2JSqyN6Ei9my4Zzj.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"め、迷惑…かけてないですよね？……それなら…いひひ…よかったです…！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/NZrd6w5Gn2MZVw0xqehvNYUreXaCSrd8.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"よく……わからないんです。本当によくわからない気持ちなのですが……うれしい……です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/4t4BzT3NOpyuxcDrLsRRQaVJas9PsA3r.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"授業や指揮をしてくださる時……なんだか先生は……あの……本当に……格好いい、というか……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/GYCZkOLpvxHJTcHFPwuS7R2M0TgtfmHY.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"わ、わたしも先生のこと……。えっと……その……。は、恥ずかしい！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/sBDppnjatK5YblcLSM9qhIQcW4zvcFzm.ogg"},{"description":"学生生日","category":"other","text":"きょ、今日はわたしの誕生日です。キヴォトスの文化の日ですからね……忘れちゃダメですよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/8dbf0t11TKwGMSK4stKEoDa8qAL8wfDf.ogg"},{"description":"玩家生日","category":"other","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生。本当に……本当に……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/5OLzjTSEf6uz8PCdzM1BbOZbwMH21s6p.ogg"},{"description":"万圣节","category":"other","text":"街が、光るカボチャと飴で溢れていますね。わ、わたしも行ってみたいです。先生と一緒に……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/lXU4nnyRR8ZnoGYDUzjvPFNM6yBSqRE3.ogg"},{"description":"新年","category":"other","text":"明けましておめでとうございます。わたし、もっと成長した姿を、お見せしますから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/OS7vSD96qOntsTedAyvrij99F80AGh5k.ogg"},{"description":"圣诞节","category":"other","text":"メ、メリークリスマス……先生。サンタとゲームは……似ています。どちらもトキメキをプレゼントしてくれるので。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/odoMXZRRATHJBCBhSoWvR7HHZeHl1k9o.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Tactic_Defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"ご、ごめんなさい！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/wSKc6hPgIkd1xzvXyLYACXTj2rIlwxgf.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Tactic_Defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"はぁ、だめぇ……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/WRKq7CM4MPtJk2WWl4MyY2uYdLzvgf05.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Tactic_In_1","category":"battle","text":"ほ、他の人たちと一緒に……？が、頑張ります。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/bkePVeuhAcIsr5NfotxJROEE7BR0D0AB.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Tactic_In_2","category":"battle","text":"えっ！ベ、ベストは尽くします！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/tJF2D8N2zEjxgYkatIS6W2TGNG8kaXVu.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Tactic_Victory_1","category":"battle","text":"ふぅ……良かったぁ……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/414CkzHxWzZRfI9M5yfwGNzkkQ9UNZYu.ogg"},{"description":"Yuzu_Tactic_Victory_2","category":"battle","text":"成功……！嬉しいです、こんな気分なんですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/IvP8zdosFfsouAdfEx0sugygF0rkFgpE.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"yuzu_battle_move_1","category":"battle","text":"总算完成了，继，继续前进。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/g5OIbXNFYLSRrSyL466NFdwmOMq6DAWm.ogg"},{"description":"yuzu_battle_move_2","category":"battle","text":"刚才好险啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/JM8NarFn3xI5dbKfTyN3AUyJcBtCyyEN.ogg"},{"description":"yuzu_battle_recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"十分感谢，您的照顾。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8A%B1%E5%86%88%20%E6%9F%9A%E5%AD%90/sOfxcMQ6KA2IEnzMOaB7BLMwkjQpSERO.ogg"},{"description":"yuzu_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":